Inside one tier and condition count, a larger cover (shorthand) comes before a
smaller one (longhand), whatever the input order.

  $ cat > a.ml <<EOT
  > [@@@css.atoms [
  >   ("_long", ["._long{margin-top:1px}"], 1, 0, 1, []);
  >   ("_mid", ["._mid{margin-inline:1px}"], 1, 0, 2, []);
  >   ("_short", ["._short{margin:1px}"], 1, 0, 4, [])
  > ]]
  > EOT

  $ styled-ppx.generate a.ml
  /* This file is generated by styled-ppx, do not edit manually */
  ._short{margin:1px}
  ._mid{margin-inline:1px}
  ._long{margin-top:1px}
